{"v":1,"book":"Exod","ch":23,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"You shall not bear a false report; do not join your hand with a wicked man to be a malicious witness.","tok":[{"t":"You shall not bear a "},{"t":"false","s":["H7723"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"report","s":["H8088"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; do not join your "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[6]},{"t":" with a "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[8]},{"t":" man to be a malicious "},{"t":"witness","s":["H5707"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"You shall not follow a multitude to do evil, nor shall you testify in a dispute so as to turn aside after a multitude to pervert justice,","tok":[{"t":"You shall not "},{"t":"follow","s":["H0310"],"a":[2]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"multitude","s":["H7227"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to do "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[4]},{"t":", nor shall you testify in a dispute so as to turn aside "},{"t":"after","s":["H0310"],"a":[10]},{"t":" a multitude to pervert justice,"}]},{"n":3,"text":"Nor shall you be partial to a poor man in his dispute.","tok":[{"t":"Nor shall you be partial to a "},{"t":"poor","s":["H1800"],"a":[0]},{"t":" man in his dispute."}]},{"n":4,"text":"If you come upon your enemy’s ox or his donkey going astray, you shall surely bring it back to him.","tok":[{"t":"If you come upon your "},{"t":"enemy’s","s":["H0341"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"ox","s":["H7794"],"a":[2]},{"t":" or his donkey going "},{"t":"astray","s":["H8582"],"a":[6]},{"t":", you shall "},{"t":"surely","s":["H7725"],"a":[7]},{"t":" bring it "},{"t":"back","s":["H7725"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"him","s":["H7725"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"If you see the donkey of one who hates you lying down under its burden, you shall refrain from leaving it to him; you shall surely release it with him.","tok":[{"t":"If you "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the donkey of one who "},{"t":"hates","s":["H8130"],"a":[3]},{"t":" you "},{"t":"lying","s":["H7257"],"a":[4]},{"t":" down under its "},{"t":"burden","s":["H4853"],"a":[6]},